OL,3,GNEWSAPolice accept Andrew search
OL,4,Awarrants were unlawful, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe investigation is ongoing and the
OL,7,Fitems seized in the raids on his homes
OL,8,Fin Norfolk and Berkshire will remain in
OL,9,Fpolice custody while his legal
OL,10,Fchallenge over the material taken
OL,11,Fcontinues.
